            "detailed_description": "Charon's train has left the station, and you’ll never believe who’s on board.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou and your fiancée were supposed to be happy, but someone's destroyed your wedding day, and your lives together. Now her ghost beckons to you from the train of death. Can you put this vicious deed to rest – and help Charon bring justice to your love’s tragic end?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won’t find in the standard version. The Collector’s Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA bonus chapter that explores Charon's origin<br />\r\nWallpapers, soundtracks, and concept art<br />\r\nAn available Strategy Guide",
